# Copy to services/relay/.dev.vars (git-ignored) to override the local `pnpm relay:dev` settings.
# Every variable is optional (uncomment to set); unset or invalid timer values mean the production limits (see README.md).

# Comma-separated origins allowed to connect. Default in dev: the local TV and companion dev servers (wrangler.toml).
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=
# Lifetime in ms of a session that never paired. pnpm relay:dev passes 60000.
# RELAY_TTL_UNPAIRED_MS=
# Maximum lifetime in ms of a paired session.
# RELAY_TTL_MAX_MS=
# Idle timeout in ms without frames.
# RELAY_IDLE_MS=
